manta --firmware ORIGINAL.bin [--headless] [--nvram overlay.cow]
--record-trace FILE --replay-trace FILE --trace-instructions
--defer-diagnostic-reads: unknown diagnostic caches stay invalid; halt at use
--virtual-rtc: guest-programmed counter with deterministic virtual clock
--cp0-timer: source-built engine Count/Compare and guest interrupt entry
--candidate-utmi: calibration handshake; analogue data unknown
--candidate-chip-id: Titania4 identity 18h inferred from stock HAL identity check
--candidate-spi: ISP read/status subset; unknown responses stop
--spi-flash w25q64bv|mx25l6405d: separate documented chip models
--defer-spi-probe: cache CF bytes as INVALID; stop before use
--exploratory-spi-input pull-up|pull-down: HYPOTHETICAL undocumented CF output
--exploratory-sc-bank N: HYPOTHETICAL initial SC selector (0..255); banked register state
--candidate-gamma: original address/sample/channel transfers, provisional virtual timing
--exploratory-display-clock HZ: HYPOTHETICAL output clock; guest timing drives output VSYNC
--exploratory-subwindow-enable 0|1: HYPOTHETICAL power-on PIP enable bit, other bits remain unknown
--exploratory-dlc-pending 0|1: HYPOTHETICAL pre-existing capture-range request; completion remains unknown
--exploratory-dlc-timeout: HYPOTHETICAL held-low completion to test original timeout path
--exploratory-comb-bank N: HYPOTHETICAL initial comb-filter bank selector
--exploratory-gamma-enable 0|1: HYPOTHETICAL initial bank-10 gamma enable bit
--summary FILE --coverage FILE --max-instructions N
--break-pc PC --pause-on-mmio PHYSICAL_ADDRESS
Diagnostic: --diagnostic-stage2 --symbolic-init --candidate-bdma
Optional diagnostic: --diagnostic-init-prefix --candidate-uart
Research peripherals: --candidate-miu --gpio-i2c
Electrical fault fixture: --i2c-sda-stuck (first bus SDA held low)
--window-smoke-test opens the native blank window briefly
Unimplemented features/options fail explicitly; see docs/STATUS.md.
